    // web-finalize-ride is asked "can this go live yet?" and mints ordinary
    // rides rows the moment phone + license clear. Identity plumbing (email
    // OTP, phone-change OTP, avatar upload) is copied from book.html so both
    // web funnels share one set of behaviors — including the two session
    // rules: never pass storageKey, always spell out autoRefreshToken.
    //
    // On web the server is the gate: everything this page validates is
